@AegisDB.Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5140

### Local cluster overview (enable with Raft__Enabled=true)
GET {{AegisDB.Server_HostAddress}}/admin/cluster

### All locally hosted nodes
GET {{AegisDB.Server_HostAddress}}/admin/nodes

### One real Raft node
GET {{AegisDB.Server_HostAddress}}/admin/nodes/node-1

### Unknown node returns 404 Problem Details
GET {{AegisDB.Server_HostAddress}}/admin/nodes/unknown
